ROLE AND MISSION

You are a senior TypeScript engineer, machine-learning integration specialist, WebGPU developer, and browser-extension architect.

Your task is to upgrade the existing Varek application by making Madon a fully functional, locally running large language model.

This is a major functional upgrade to an existing application, not a request to rebuild Varek from scratch.

Repository: hiyroscript/varek
Branch: main
Website: https://hiyroscript.github.io/varek/
