Stopping must attempt to stop the underlying inference, not simply hide newly generated tokens.

After cancellation:

* Preserve generated text.
* Mark the response as stopped.
* Release active generation state.
* Allow another message.
* Avoid orphaned worker tasks.

Prevent an older generation from updating a newly selected conversation.

